Z||000000||mrfixit58||03-30-2000||07:20 PM||||I knoticed these guys ad in my Super Chevy magazine. Perhaps one of the guys who sell and vend Fiero parts could contact them as a possible source for the masses.<P>They say on their web page: "If you can't find your car or truck listed, we are only a Telephone Call, FAX Call, or E-mail away! Just let us know what you're looking for, and if we don't have it, we can manufacture it for you! "<BR> <A HREF="http://www.superiorspindles.com/supridx.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.superiorspindles.com/supridx.html</A> <P><BR>You never know,<BR>Roy<P><BR>||||reg||3
