Z||000003||mrfixit58||03-30-2000||08:23 PM||||Spyder,<P>Please let us know what they say. I was going to do the same thing as you and just contact them but I thought if FIEROSHOP or RODNEY or one of the other supplier/vendor types on our forum contacted them that they would take the request a little more serious. If that doesn't happen then I guess we'll have to contact them in "mass request" form to show them we're serious.<P>I'm truly surprised that we're having such a hard time finding a supplier of these things. It seems to me that a large percentage of the kit car market still depends on the Fiero as the donor. And, almost all of those kits require some kind of lowering. We'll just have to wait and see.<P>Roy||||reg||1
